y"> <div class="text-for-plus">+</div> <div class="text-for-minus">-</div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="height:0PX" class="faq-answer"> <div class="elments-wrapp"> <div class="margine-top-25px-copy">Blueprints are how Radix smart contracts start life. They are reusable pieces of functionality that allow developers to contribute and leverage code that isn’t just open – it’s alive and proven out every day. Combined with the built in on-ledger Developer Royalties system, developers can rely on receiving rewards on network level.</div><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/664b66e48db820abb34879cc_Group-2472-1.png" alt="" class="image-67-copy"> </div> </div> <div class="grey-line"></div> </div> </div> <div class="apsolute-button"> <div class="c-cta-holder-2 is-second"><img src="/assets/6640836ec3b7eac1f6681505_Scrypto-Icon-Round3x.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cta-wallet-img smaller"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/" class="cta-inner-2 is-second-blue w-inline-block"> <div class="cta-right-2"> <div class="text-size-18-2 txtm2">Get Started with Scrypto</div> <div class="cta-chevron-box"><img src="/assets/66408373c3b7eac1f668182a_chevron-right.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-blue"><img src="/assets/6643b86c5d959785f997eb09_chevron-right.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-green"></div> </div> </a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="menu-featured-grid"> <div id="w-node-e572d0d3-55c0-8b91-4a5a-80f3cff81728-3cdb888b" class="menu-featured-wrapper"><img src="/assets/663ff168fc0777a7774ed82a_Group-2464-2.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="img-oriented-2 is-1"> <h3 class="text-size-18-2 is-semi-bold max-width-200 is-mobile--text">Fastest route from idea to production</h3> </div> <div id="w-node-e572d0d3-55c0-8b91-4a5a-80f3cff8172c-3cdb888b" class="menu-featured-wrapper"><img src="/assets/66408377c3b7eac1f6682139_Orientated-02.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="img-oriented-2"> <h3 class="text-size-18-2 is-semi-bold max-width-200 is-mobile--text">Programmable<br>Dev Royalties</h3> </div> <div id="w-node-e572d0d3-55c0-8b91-4a5a-80f3cff81732-3cdb888b" class="menu-featured-wrapper"><img src="/assets/66408375c3b7eac1f6681e97_Orientated-03.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="img-oriented-2"> <h3 class="text-size-18-2 is-semi-bold max-width-200 is-mobile--text">Security by default with Radix Engine</h3> </div> <div id="w-node-e572d0d3-55c0-8b91-4a5a-80f3cff81736-3cdb888b" class="menu-featured-wrapper"><img src="/assets/66408377c3b7eac1f668215b_Orientated-04.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="img-oriented-2"> <h3 class="text-size-18-2 is-semi-bold max-width-200 is-mobile--text">intuitive Developer onboarding</h3> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="get-started" class="c-bg-section-2"> <div class="devider-white-image is-copy"><img src="/images/Vector-190.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-77 copy"></div> <div id="join-community" class="c-logo-triangle-2 hide-mobile"> <div id="why-radix" class="container-sticky-2 is-zindex is-apsolute"> <div class="containeer_1062 ctabox"><img src="/assets/664265ab8f8a7d64e8f7dce8_Group-2194.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-76"> <div class="right-part is-flex"> <div class="question-text-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-24 bold text-size-18px">Want to dive deeper into the technology powering Radix?</h4> <div class="max-width-720px">The user and developer experience shown here is exclusively possible due to each layer of the Radix tech stack.</div> </div> <div class="w-layout-hflex flex-block-3"> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/whitepapers" target="_blank" class="t_button-10 flex w-inline-block"> <div class="text-size-18-2 text-color-blue">Technical Whitepapers</div> <div class="btn-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.54289 17.9571C8.15237 17.5666 8.15237 16.9334 8.54289 16.5429L13.3358 11.75L8.54289 6.95711C8.15237 6.56658 8.15237 5.93342 8.54289 5.54289C8.93342 5.15237 9.56658 5.15237 9.95711 5.54289L15.4571 11.0429C15.8476 11.4334 15.8476 12.0666 15.4571 12.4571L9.95711 17.9571C9.56658 18.3476 8.93342 18.3476 8.54289 17.9571Z" fill="#003057"></path> </svg></div> </a> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/full-stack" target="_blank" class="t_button-10 is_blue w-inline-block"> <div class="text-size-18-2">Full Stack Overview</div> <div class="btn-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.54289 17.9571C8.15237 17.5666 8.15237 16.9334 8.54289 16.5429L13.3358 11.75L8.54289 6.95711C8.15237 6.56658 8.15237 5.93342 8.54289 5.54289C8.93342 5.15237 9.56658 5.15237 9.95711 5.54289L15.4571 11.0429C15.8476 11.4334 15.8476 12.0666 15.4571 12.4571L9.95711 17.9571C9.56658 18.3476 8.93342 18.3476 8.54289 17.9571Z" fill="#ffffff"></path> </svg></div> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="c-content"> <div id="dApp-and-tools" class="container-sticky-2 is-more-tp"> <div id="build-dApp-tools" class="linker"></div> <div class="center"> <div class="c-title-span is-titile2 no-margine-bottom">Turn ideas to projects</div> <h2 class="bm-20 text-color-white text-size-30px less-space">Start Building on Radix</h2> </div> <div id="dApp" class="faq-block hide-mobile"> <div class="c-section-faq is-first"> <div data-w-id="e572d0d3-55c0-8b91-4a5a-80f3cff8175a" class="faq-question-copy"> <div class="question-text-wrapp"> <div class="text-size-42-2 bold no-bm">Get Started</div> <div class="max-width-720px is-faq">Take the first steps to begin building on Radix.</div> </div> <div class="question-button-wrapper question-button-wrapper-copy"> <div class="faq-plus-wrap faq-plus-wrap-copy"> <div style="display:none" class="text-for-plus">+</div> <div style="display:block" class="text-for-minus">-</div> </div> <div style="display:none" class="semi-bold is-extand">Expand</div> <div style="display:block" class="semi-bold is-colapse">Collapse</div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-answer"> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Your First Steps</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">View Radix Docs</h4> <div>Documentation and guides to build your dApp.</div> </a> <a href="https://academy.radixdlt.com/" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Learn with Scrypto 101</h4> <div>Guided course on writing your first smart contract with Scrypto.</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Guides and Examples</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid is-last"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/learning-step-by-step" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Step-by-step Learning</h4> <div>Learn Step-by-step with this guide that covers the basics of Scrypto all the way to a full dApp with a frontend.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/learning-to-run-your-first-scrypto-project" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Run your First Scrypto Project</h4> <div>We will guide you through running and interacting with Scrypto using the Radix Engine Simulator.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/learning-to-create-your-first-custom-resource" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Create your First Custom Resource</h4> <div>Create a wide range of resources, including fungible and non-fungible tokens, simple tokens, or more complex authorization badges.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/learning-to-run-the-gumball-machine-front-end-dapp" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Gumball Machine Example</h4> <div>See an example dApp and code that features core Radix tools, allowing users to purchase a gumball in exchange for XRD.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/run-the-radiswap-dapp" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Run the Radiswap Example</h4> <div>See an example DEX and code that features core Radix tools, allowing users to deposit and swap between two tokens.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/learning-to-create-and-use-transaction-manifests" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold"><strong>Create and Submit your First Transaction</strong></h4> <div>We&#x27;ll guide you through the process of creating a transaction using the Transaction Manifest and show you how to submit your first transaction on Stokenet (test network).</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/learning-to-run-your-first-front-end-dapp" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold"><strong>Integrating your Front End to your Smart Contract</strong></h4> <div>This guide will demonstrate how to enable users to interact with your dApp from a website by integrating the Radix dApp Toolkit into your frontend.</div> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="c-section-faq"> <div class="faq-question"> <div class="question-text-wrapp"> <div class="text-size-42-2 bold no-bm">Builder Tools</div> <div class="max-width-720px is-faq">Official developer tooling to build a dApp, create transactions, browse, and communicate with the Radix Network.</div> </div> <div class="question-button-wrapper question-button-wrapper-copy"> <div class="faq-plus-wrap faq-plus-wrap-copy"> <div class="text-for-plus">+</div> <div class="text-for-minus">-</div> </div> <div class="semi-bold is-extand">Expand</div> <div class="semi-bold is-colapse">Collapse</div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-answer"> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Front-end</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/en/dapp-toolkit" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix dApp Toolkit</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Easily integrate a Radix Connect Button to your dApp for mobile-to-mobile or desktop-to-mobile user wallet connection.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/en/gateway-sdk" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Gateway SDK</h4> <div class="text-block-36">The TypeScript Gateway SDK provides an easy way to query state on the Radix Network.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/rola-radix-off-ledger-auth" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">ROLA</h4> <div class="text-block-36">An authentication system which utilizes the Radix Network to provide passwordless logins and proof of account ownership on Radix for your frontend and backend systems.</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Back-end</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid"> <a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=RadixPublishing.radix-developer-tools" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix Developer Tools</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Radix Developer Tools for Visual Studio Code help you build and deploy Radix applications using Scrypto and the Radix DLT Network.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/rust-manifest-builder" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Rust Manifest Builder</h4> <div class="text-block-36">The Rust Manifest Builder allows you to write transaction manifests directly within the Rust environment while building your Scrypto package.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/en/radix-engine-toolkit" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix Engine Toolkit</h4> <div class="text-block-36">The Radix Engine Toolkit is a multi-language library offering Scrypto and Radix Engine types, functions, and primitives for off-ledger applications.</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Network</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid is-last"> <a href="https://dashboard.radixdlt.com/" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix Dashboard: Mainnet</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Lets you search for transactions, accounts, and more on the Mainnet network.</div> </a> <a href="https://stokenet-dashboard.radixdlt.com/" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix Dashboard: Stokenet</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Lets you search for transactions, accounts, and more on the Stokenet network.</div> </a> <a href="https://console.radixdlt.com/" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix Console: Mainnet</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Provides utility pages for developers, including Deploy Package, Create Token, Configure Metadata, Send Raw Transaction, and Convert Olympia Address on the Mainnet network.</div> </a> <a href="https://stokenet-console.radixdlt.com/" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix Console: Stokenet</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Provides utility pages for developers, including Deploy Package, Create Token, Configure Metadata, Send Raw Transaction, and Convert Olympia Address on the Stokenet network.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/v1/docs/network-apis" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Network APIs</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Radix offers several key APIs designed for different use cases, enabling developers to interact with the Radix network efficiently.</div> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="c-section-faq"> <div class="faq-question"> <div class="question-text-wrapp"> <div class="text-size-42-2 bold no-bm-copy">Build a dApp</div> <div class="max-width-720px is-faq">Guides and recommended patterns for production dApp deployment on the Radix Network.</div> </div> <div class="question-button-wrapper question-button-wrapper-copy"> <div class="faq-plus-wrap faq-plus-wrap-copy"> <div class="text-for-plus">+</div> <div class="text-for-minus">-</div> </div> <div class="semi-bold is-extand">Expand</div> <div class="semi-bold is-colapse">Collapse</div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-answer"> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Radix Application Stack</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/dapp-frontend-development" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">dApp Front-end Development</h4> <div class="text-block-36">A pure frontend dApp connects to a user&#x27;s Radix Wallet, gets data from the Radix Network, and proposes transactions, without a server backend.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/fullstack-dapp-development" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Full-stack dApp Development</h4> <div class="text-block-36">A full-stack dApp includes a server backend to handle tasks that a pure frontend dApp cannot.</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Scrypto</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/resources" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Resources</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Resources (tokens/assets) are crucial in Scrypto for safer, predictable transactions. Native to Radix Engine, enforcing correct behaviors.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/auth" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Authorization</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Authorization allows a caller to invoke methods or functions. Scrypto provides a built-in system using Badges, AccessRules, and Roles.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/en/using-royalties" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Using Royalties</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Radix&#x27;s native royalty system automatically collects developer-specified fees whenever a blueprint or component is used in a transaction.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/scrypto-test" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Scrypto Test</h4> <div class="text-block-36">This testing framework lets developers write Scrypto-like code to test their packages and blueprints.</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Design Patterns</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid is-last"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/scrypto-design-patterns" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Reference Designs</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Explore all design patterns including User Badge, Actor Virtual Badge, Transiente Badge, Reusable Blueprints, The Withdraw Pattern, and Patterns for Application use cases.</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/reusable-blueprints-pattern" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Reusable Blueprints</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Best practice for blueprint developers to ensure reusability and benefit from royalties by publishing to the blueprint catalog (blueprint catalog coming soon).</div> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/user-badge-pattern" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Users with Badges</h4> <div class="text-block-36">This pattern solves how to identify admins or authorized users. Unlike address-based checks, badges ensure secure and composable authorizations.</div> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="dApp" class="faq-block unhide-mobile"> <div class="c-section-faq is-first"> <div class="faq-question"> <div class="question-text-wrapp less-space"> <div class="text-size-42-2 bold text-size-30px less-space">Get Started</div> <div class="max-width-720px is-faq">The user and developer experience shown here is exclusively possible due to each layer of the Radix tech stack.</div> </div> <div class="question-button-wrapper question-button-wrapper-copy"> <div class="faq-plus-wrap faq-plus-wrap-copy"> <div class="text-for-plus">+</div> <div class="text-for-minus">-</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-answer"> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Your First Steps</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">View Radix Docs</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Documentation and guides to build your dApp.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://academy.radixdlt.com/course/scrypto101" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Learn with Scrypto 101</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Guided course on writing your first smart contracts with Scrypto.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> </div> </div> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Guides and Examples</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid is-last"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/learning-step-by-step" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Step-by-step Learning</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Learn Step-by-step with this guide that covers the basics of Scrypto all the way to a full dApp with a frontend.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/learning-to-run-your-first-scrypto-project" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Run your First Scrypto Project</h4> <div class="text-block-36">We will guide you through running and interacting with Scrypto using the Radix Engine Simulator.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/learning-to-create-your-first-custom-resource" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Create your First Custom Resource</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Create a wide range of resources, including fungible and non-fungible tokens, simple tokens, or more complex authorization badges.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/learning-to-run-the-gumball-machine-front-end-dapp" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Gumball Machine Example</h4> <div class="text-block-36">See an example dApp and code that features core Radix tools, allowing users to purchase a gumball in exchange for XRD.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/run-the-radiswap-dapp" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Run the Radiswap Example</h4> <div class="text-block-36">See an example DEX and code that features core Radix tools, allowing users to deposit and swap between two tokens.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="c-section-faq"> <div class="faq-question"> <div class="question-text-wrapp less-space"> <div class="text-size-42-2 bold text-size-30px less-space">Builder Tools</div> <div class="max-width-720px is-faq">The user and developer experience shown here is exclusively possible due to each layer of the Radix tech stack.</div> </div> <div class="question-button-wrapper question-button-wrapper-copy"> <div class="faq-plus-wrap faq-plus-wrap-copy"> <div class="text-for-plus">+</div> <div class="text-for-minus">-</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-answer"> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Front-end</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/en/dapp-toolkit" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix dApp Toolkit</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Combines Wallet and Gateway SDKs with a framework-agnostic Connect Button, simplifying user connection to dApps.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/en/gateway-sdk" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Gateway SDK</h4> <div class="text-block-36">The TypeScript Gateway SDK provides an easy way to query state on the Radix Network.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/rola-radix-off-ledger-auth" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">ROLA</h4> <div class="text-block-36">ROLA authenticates user claims in your dApp with the Radix Wallet, leveraging the Radix Network for a decentralized flexible solution.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> </div> </div> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Back-end</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid"> <a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=RadixPublishing.radix-developer-tools" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix Developer Tools</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Radix Developer Tools for Visual Studio Code help you build and deploy Radix applications using Scrypto and the Radix DLT Network..</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/rust-manifest-builder" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Rust Manifest Builder</h4> <div class="text-block-36">The Rust Manifest Builder allows you to write transaction manifests directly within the Rust environment while building your Scrypto package.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> </div> </div> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Network</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid is-last"> <a href="https://dashboard.radixdlt.com/" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix Dashboard: Mainnet</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Lets you search for transactions, accounts, and more on the Mainnet network.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://stokenet-dashboard.radixdlt.com/" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix Dashboard: Stokenet</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Lets you search for transactions, accounts, and more on the Stokenet network.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://console.radixdlt.com/" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix Console: Mainnet</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Provides utility pages for developers, including Deploy Package, Create Token, Configure Metadata, Send Raw Transaction, and Convert Olympia Address on the Mainnet network.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://stokenet-console.radixdlt.com/" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix Console: Stokenet</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Provides utility pages for developers, including Deploy Package, Create Token, Configure Metadata, Send Raw Transaction, and Convert Olympia Address on the Stokenet network.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/en/radix-engine-toolkit" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Radix Engine Toolkit</h4> <div class="text-block-36">The Radix Engine Toolkit is a multi-language library offering Scrypto and Radix Engine types, functions, and primitives for off-ledger applications.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/en/radix-engine-toolkit" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Gateway API</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Offers low-level and high-level abstractions, primarily for dApp website frontends and general network clients like dashboards.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://www.figma.com/design/0rGAVVsduemeUTbFKYlnA1?node-id=174-3291#802712834" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Network APIs</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Radix offers several key APIs designed for different use cases, enabling developers to interact with the Radix network efficiently.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="c-section-faq"> <div class="faq-question"> <div class="question-text-wrapp less-space"> <div class="text-size-42-2 bold text-size-30px less-space">Build a dApp</div> <div class="max-width-720px is-faq">The user and developer experience shown here is exclusively possible due to each layer of the Radix tech stack.</div> </div> <div class="question-button-wrapper question-button-wrapper-copy"> <div class="faq-plus-wrap faq-plus-wrap-copy"> <div class="text-for-plus">+</div> <div class="text-for-minus">-</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-answer"> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Radix Application Stack</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/dapp-frontend-development" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">dApp Front-end Development</h4> <div class="text-block-36">A pure frontend dApp connects to a user&#x27;s Radix Wallet, gets data from the Radix Network, and proposes transactions, without a server backend.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/fullstack-dapp-development" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Full-stack dApp Development</h4> <div class="text-block-36">A full-stack dApp includes a server backend to handle tasks that a pure frontend dApp cannot.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> </div> </div> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Scrypto</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/en/auth" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Resources</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Resources (tokens/assets) are crucial in Scrypto for safer, predictable transactions. Native to Radix Engine, enforcing correct behaviors.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a id="w-node-e572d0d3-55c0-8b91-4a5a-80f3cff81928-3cdb888b" href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/en/reusable-blueprints-pattern" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Authorization</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Authorization allows a caller to invoke methods or functions. Scrypto provides a built-in system using Badges, AccessRules, and Roles.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/en/user-badge-pattern" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Using Royalties</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Radix&#x27;s native royalty system automatically collects developer-specified fees whenever a blueprint or component is used in a transaction.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/account-deposit-patterns" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Scrypto Test</h4> <div class="text-block-36">This testing framework lets developers write Scrypto-like code to test their packages and blueprints.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> </div> </div> <div class="faq-row"> <h3 class="text-size-24px is-weight">Design Patterns</h3> <div class="w-layout-grid c-section-faq-grid is-last"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/scrypto-design-patterns" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Reference Designs</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Explore all design patterns including User Badge, Actor Virtual Badge, Transiente Badge, Reusable Blueprints, The Withdraw Pattern, and Patterns for Application use cases.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://github.com/radixdlt/official-examples/tree/main/step-by-step/08-ledger-ready-gumball-machine#publishing-the-gumball-machine" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Reusable Blueprints</h4> <div class="text-block-36">Best practice for blueprint developers to ensure reusability and benefit from royalties by publishing to the blueprint catalog (blueprint catalog coming soon).</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/docs/en/dapp-definition-setup" target="_blank" class="c-section-faq-block w-inline-block"> <div class="elements-wrapp"> <h4 class="text-size-18-semi-bold">Users with Badges</h4> <div class="text-block-36">This pattern solves how to identify admins or authorized users. Unlike address-based checks, badges ensure secure and composable authorizations.</div> </div><img src="/assets/6645184aaa1e0ef31b7d5e2f_chevron-right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-only-mobile"> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="mesh2" class="mesh-holder-6 purple dnone"> <div data-poster-url="/assets/6644c07baf8d32e12c4d32c7_Dev_2K_WithoutElement-poster-00001.jpg" data-video-urls="/assets/6644c07baf8d32e12c4d32c7_Dev_2K_WithoutElement-transcode.mp4,/assets/6644c07baf8d32e12c4d32c7_Dev_2K_WithoutElement-transcode.webm" data-autoplay="true" data-loop="true" data-wf-ignore="true" data-beta-bgvideo-upgrade="false" class="mesh-vid-2 z5 w-background-video w-background-video-atom"><video id="e572d0d3-55c0-8b91-4a5a-80f3cff81957-video" autoplay="" loop="" style="background-image:url(&quot;/assets/6644c07baf8d32e12c4d32c7_Dev_2K_Withou